    "YOU_NEED_TO_INVITE_%@_BEFORE_HAVING_DISCUSSION_ALERT_MESSAGE": {
      "comment": "A message that appears in an alert when a user taps the chat button on a one-to-one contact that they haven't invited yet. The placeholder is replaced with the contact's nickname or short name",
